source: crates/hydronode-cli/tests/c3_help.rs
expression: text
---
Your automations, what triggers them and when they last ran.

Usage: hn automations [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list     List automations
  show     Trigger, actions and recent runs of one automation
  enable   Switch an automation on
  disable  Switch an automation off

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn automations
  hn automations show <id>
  hn automations disable <id>
